# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets and host build output.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store
.git
.github
.claude
.vercel

# Never send env files (secrets) to the build
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/api/test/.env.test

# Not needed in the image
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
docs
